          "@value": "Property"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "Every type 'Entity' and 'Relationship' can have an individual set of configurable properties, each of which is uniquely defined by id (name), datatype and range. A Property is an owl:DatatypeProperty."
